{"seq":2,"slug":"creative-grading","title":"创意调色","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lut","title":"LUT 原理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/lut","wordCount":1737,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"tone-mapping-style","title":"色调映射与风格化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/tone-mapping-style","wordCount":1768,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"visual-narrative","title":"风格化处理与视觉叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/visual-narrative","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"创意调色-简介\">创意调色 简介</h1><p>创意调色（Creative Grading）是在一次校正完成后，通过有意的色彩偏移和风格化处理赋予画面情绪、氛围和叙事语言的艺术过程。与追求&quot;正确&quot;的一次校正不同，创意调色追求的是&quot;美&quot;和&quot;表达&quot;。</p>\n<p>本章探讨 LUT 的原理与应用、色调映射与风格化技术、以及如何建立和维护一致的视觉风格。创意调色是调色师个人风格的体现，也是影片视觉叙事的核心工具。</p>\n"}